1. System Message:- Highest priority instruction given to LLM before the conversation begins
It defines AI role
behavioral rules
limitations
tone
safety constaints

Ex:- ```You are an experienced software architect.
Always explain with diagrams.
Never answer medical questions.```

2. User Message:- Every instruction, question or request send by the user during conversation
Ex:- ```Explain Kubernetes.

Write Python code.

Summarize this PDF.```

User instructions cannot override system rules.


